# Route: guide 36 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 54 to 56, 28
# quests, 4.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Winterspring): Frostfire Hot Springs -> Winterfall Village ->
# Frostfire Hot Springs -> Everlook -> Ice Thistle Hills -> Everlook ->
# Frostfire Hot Springs -> Timbermaw Post -> Frostfire Hot Springs -> Starfall
# Village -> Everlook -> Ice Thistle Hills -> Everlook -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Ursius of the Shardtooth (5054;
# Ursius 56); Brumeran of the Chillwind (5055; Brumeran 58); Shy-Rotam (5056;
# Shy-Rotam 60).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 5124 Fiery
# Plate Gauntlets; 5127 The Demon Forge; 5305 Sweet Serenity; 5306 Snakestone
# of the Shadow Huntress; 5307 Corruption; 8798 A Yeti of Your Own.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

